{"suttaId":"thag16.6","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[3206,3278],"vripara":"818"},"segments":{"thag16.6:0.4":"Selattheragāthā","thag16.6:1.1":"“Paripuṇṇakāyo suruci, sujāto cārudassano;","thag16.6:1.3":"Suvaṇṇavaṇṇosi bhagavā, susukkadāṭhosi vīriyavā [susukkadāṭho virīyavā (sī.)].","thag16.6:2.1":"“Narassa hi sujātassa, ye bhavanti viyañjanā;","thag16.6:2.3":"Sabbe te tava kāyasmiṃ, mahāpurisalakkhaṇā.","thag16.6:3.1":"“Pasannanetto sumukho, brahā uju patāpavā;","thag16.6:3.3":"Majjhe samaṇasaṅghassa, ādiccova virocasi.","thag16.6:4.1":"“Kalyāṇadassano bhikkhu, kañcanasannibhattaco;","thag16.6:4.3":"Kiṃ te samaṇabhāvena, evaṃ uttamavaṇṇino.","thag16.6:5.1":"“Rājā arahasi bhavituṃ, cakkavattī rathesabho;","thag16.6:5.3":"Cāturanto vijitāvī, jambusaṇḍassa [jambumaṇḍassa (ka.)] issaro.","thag16.6:6.1":"“Khattiyā bhogī rājāno [bhogā rājāno (sī. ka.), bhojarājāno (syā.)], anuyantā bhavanti te;","thag16.6:6.3":"Rājābhirājā [rājādhirājā (sī. ka.)] manujindo, rajjaṃ kārehi gotama”.","thag16.6:7.1":"“Rājāhamasmi sela,(selāti bhagavā) dhammarājā anuttaro;","thag16.6:7.4":"Dhammena cakkaṃ vattemi, cakkaṃ appaṭivattiyaṃ”.","thag16.6:8.1":"“Sambuddho paṭijānāsi,(iti selo brāhmaṇo) dhammarājā anuttaro;","thag16.6:8.4":"‘Dhammena cakkaṃ vattemi’, iti bhāsatha gotama.","thag16.6:9.1":"“Ko nu senāpati bhoto, sāvako satthuranvayo [anvayo (sī.)];","thag16.6:9.3":"Ko tetamanuvatteti, dhammacakkaṃ pavattitaṃ”.","thag16.6:10.1":"“Mayā pavattitaṃ cakkaṃ,(selāti bhagavā) dhammacakkaṃ anuttaraṃ;","thag16.6:10.4":"Sāriputto anuvatteti, anujāto tathāgataṃ.","thag16.6:11.1":"“Abhiññeyyaṃ abhiññātaṃ, bhāvetabbañca bhāvitaṃ;","thag16.6:11.3":"Pahātabbaṃ pahīnaṃ me, tasmā buddhosmi brāhmaṇa.","thag16.6:12.1":"“Vinayassu mayi kaṅkhaṃ, adhimuñcassu brāhmaṇa;","thag16.6:12.3":"Dullabhaṃ dassanaṃ hoti, sambuddhānaṃ abhiṇhaso.","thag16.6:13.1":"“Yesaṃ ve dullabho loke, pātubhāvo abhiṇhaso;","thag16.6:13.3":"Sohaṃ brāhmaṇa buddhosmi, sallakatto [sallakanto (sī.)] anuttaro.","thag16.6:14.1":"“Brahmabhūto atitulo, mārasenappamaddano;","thag16.6:14.3":"Sabbāmitte vase [vasī (syā. ka., ma. ni.2.399; su. ni.966)] katvā, modāmi akutobhayo”.","thag16.6:15.1":"“Idaṃ bhonto nisāmetha, yathā bhāsati cakkhumā;","thag16.6:15.3":"Sallakatto mahāvīro, sīhova nadatī vane.","thag16.6:16.1":"“Brahmabhūtaṃ atitulaṃ, mārasenappamaddanaṃ;","thag16.6:16.3":"Ko disvā nappasīdeyya, api kaṇhābhijātiko.","thag16.6:17.1":"“Yo maṃ icchati anvetu, yo vā nicchati gacchatu;","thag16.6:17.3":"Idhāhaṃ pabbajissāmi, varapaññassa santike”.","thag16.6:18.1":"“Etaṃ ce ruccati bhoto, sammāsambuddhasāsanaṃ;","thag16.6:18.3":"Mayampi pabbajissāma, varapaññassa santike.","thag16.6:19.1":"“Brāhmaṇā tisatā ime, yācanti pañjalīkatā;","thag16.6:19.3":"‘Brahmacariyaṃ carissāma, bhagavā tava santike’”.","thag16.6:20.1":"“Svākhātaṃ brahmacariyaṃ,(selāti bhagavā) sandiṭṭhikamakālikaṃ;","thag16.6:20.4":"Yattha amoghā pabbajjā, appamattassa sikkhato”.","thag16.6:21.1":"“Yaṃ taṃ saraṇamāgamha [saraṇamāgamma (sabbattha)], ito aṭṭhame [aṭṭhami (syā. ka.)] cakkhuma;","thag16.6:21.3":"Sattarattena bhagavā, dantāmha tava sāsane.","thag16.6:22.1":"“Tuvaṃ buddho tuvaṃ satthā, tuvaṃ mārābhibhū muni;","thag16.6:22.3":"Tuvaṃ anusaye chetvā, tiṇṇo tāresimaṃ pajaṃ.","thag16.6:23.1":"“Upadhī te samatikkantā, āsavā te padālitā;","thag16.6:23.3":"Sīhova anupādāno, pahīnabhayabheravo.","thag16.6:24.1":"“Bhikkhavo tisatā ime, tiṭṭhanti pañjalīkatā;","thag16.6:24.3":"Pāde vīra pasārehi, nāgā vandantu satthuno”ti.","thag16.6:24.5":"… Selo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
